Here is the definition I have. Maybe it's obsolete now.
x1 is a train [vehicle] of cars/units x2 (mass) for rails/system/railroad
x3, propelled by x4.
[a railed vehicle or train of vehicles; also subway (tu'unre'e), metro,
trolley, tramway (= lajre'e), roller coaster; monorail (= dadre'e); cable
car, sky car, ski lift (= cildadre'e)]

It seems pretty clear to me that it's talking only about railed transport
systems and not caravans or animals.

stevo

